# Nothing else is actually ignored in this demo, so the full proposed structure is visible.
# In the real repo, these would also be gitignored:
#   mnt/                            (sshfs mount points)
#   displaced_leptons/displaced_leptons/         (separate git repo)
#   displaced_leptons/DisplacedLeptonsSupplement/ (separate git repo)
#   <same pattern for each other analysis's child repo(s)>

# ref/ is real here, not a placeholder: it holds per-machine symlinks to local
# framework checkouts (e.g. disappearing_tracks/ref/DisappTrks_Nano), so it's
# ignored for real to avoid committing someone's personal absolute path.
**/ref/

# Group-wide read-only reference clones (cloned by scripts/setup.py); the
# references/README.md itself stays tracked.
references/*
!references/README.md

# CLAUDE.local.md and .mount-config.local.sh are also real here, not
# placeholders: scripts/setup.py can write real per-machine data into them
# (LPC username, CMSSW work-area paths), so they're ignored for real too. The root
# CLAUDE.local.md was previously committed with demo-only scaffold text; it's
# untracked now (see git history) but the file itself is left in place.
.mount-config.local.sh
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
